r exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".\n\nDATA (build the UI around this content):\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Aero 14\",\n    \"tagline\": \"Light, bright, long-lasting\",\n    \"price\": 1299,\n    \"weightKg\": 1.2,\n    \"batteryH\": 18,\n    \"screen\": \"14\\\" OLED\",\n    \"cpu\": \"8-core, 15 W\",\n    \"ramGb\": 16,\n    \"storageGb\": 512,\n    \"ports\": [\n      \"2x USB-C\",\n      \"HDMI\",\n      \"headphone\"\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 4.6,\n    \"reviews\": 1840,\n    \"pros\": [\n      \"Gorgeous OLED panel\",\n      \"Great battery\",\n      \"Quiet under load\"\n    ],\n    \"cons\": [\n      \"Soldered RAM\",\n      \"Glossy screen\"\n    ],\n    \"bestFor\": \"Travel and everyday work\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Forge 16\",\n    \"tagline\": \"Desktop power on the go\",\n    \"price\": 1899,\n    \"weightKg\": 2.1,\n    \"batteryH\": 9,\n    \"screen\": \"16\\\" IPS 165Hz\",\n    \"cpu\": \"16-core, 55 W\",\n    \"ramGb\": 32,\n    \"storageGb\": 1024,\n    \"ports\": [\n      \"2x USB-C\",\n      \"3x USB-A\",\n      \"HDMI\",\n      \"Ethernet\",\n      \"SD card\"\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 4.4,\n    \"reviews\": 960,\n    \"pros\": [\n      \"Fastest of the three\",\n      \"Upgradeable RAM and SSD\",\n      \"Full port selection\"\n    ],\n    \"cons\": [\n      \"Heavy\",\n      \"Fans are audible\"\n    ],\n    \"bestFor\": \"Video editing, 3D and 